Topic? ADD

ADD

     This command allows you to add one or more lines to the FDL
     file. If the line already exists, you can optionally replace
     it with the new line. After you insert a line, you can optionally
     continue to add lines under that particular primary section. If
     no primary section exists to hold the secondary attribute being
     added, one is automatically created.

     Format

       ADD
   



  Additional information available:

  Example

ADD Subtopic? TITLE

